  opt_err_value.adam - @optimize's value and count (PLAN-ADAM M6 O1, BNF's
  directive values): a name that is no level is CD0016 at the name, listing
  the levels (exact case: Fast is none); a second @optimize is CD0015
*******************************************************************************/

/*
@@test
  kind error
@@end
*/

module exe opt_err_value;

@optimize Fast; // ERROR CD0016@11: 'Fast' is not an optimization level; accepted: debug, safe, fast, small
@optimize safe; // ERROR CD0015@1: @optimize is given twice

begin
end.
